version: "2.0"
description: Composite GitHub Actions shared by the workflows in ../workflows.

components:
  install-deps-action:
    description: >-
      install-deps — npm ci plus the npm/cli#4828 workaround: installs the
      native bindings @rollup/rollup-<triple> (tsup) and @rolldown/binding-<triple>
      (vitest/vite), triple = <platform>-<arch>[-gnu|-musl|-msvc] derived from
      process.platform/arch (glibc detected via process.report), at the resolved
      host package version, skipping when already present or the host is absent. Was hardcoded to
      linux-x64-gnu, which breaks tsup on Windows/macOS runners resolved from a
      lockfile made on another OS. Used by ci.yml, release.yml and gnomon.yml.
    path: install-deps/action.yml
    tags: [ci]
